---
<Layout
  title="Selected Work — Param Dave"
  description="Case studies in reliable LLM systems, 3D perception, and turning machine-learning research into production systems."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pt-11 pb-9 sm:pt-14">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-amber-600 uppercase dark:text-amber-400">
      Selected work
    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
      Business constraints, research questions, shipped systems.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
      Each case starts with an outcome that matters, works down through the technical
      uncertainty, and ends with something measurable, reliable, and useful in a real workflow.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
      {caseStudies.map((study) => (
        <a
          href={`#${study.id}`}
          class="rounded-md border border-stone-200 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-stone-600 hover:border-amber-500 hover:text-amber-600 dark:border-stone-800 dark:text-stone-400 dark:hover:border-amber-400 dark:hover:text-amber-400"
        >
          {study.area}
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-500">
      These case studies deliberately describe the technical decisions and outcomes without
      exposing proprietary data, customer material, or internal system details.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-10">
    <Meme
      imgWidth="270px"
      src="benchmark-vs-production.webp"
      alt="Drake rejecting one option and approving another in a two-panel reaction meme."
      width={400}
      height={322}
    >
      <div slot="overlay" class="top-0 absolute right-0 flex h-1/2 w-[51%] items-center justify-center p-[3cqw] text-center text-[8cqw] leading-none font-black tracking-tight text-white" style="font-family: Impact, Haettenschweiler, 'Arial Narrow Bold', sans-serif; -webkit-text-stroke: 0.35cqw #111; text-shadow: 0.25cqw 0.25cqw 0 #111;">Benchmarks</div>
      <div slot="overlay" class="bottom-0 absolute right-0 flex h-1/2 w-[51%] items-center justify-center p-[3cqw] text-center text-[8cqw] leading-none font-black tracking-tight text-white" style="font-family: Impact, Haettenschweiler, 'Arial Narrow Bold', sans-serif; -webkit-text-stroke: 0.35cqw #111; text-shadow: 0.25cqw 0.25cqw 0 #111;">Production<br />Results</div>
      <p class="handwritten marker inline text-[17px] text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-100">
        Benchmarks are polite. Production data is more honest.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
        The benchmark gets the system out the door. The anomaly decides what I investigate next.
      </p>
    </Meme>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-12">
    <div class="space-y-8">
      {caseStudies.map((study) => (
        <article id={study.id} class="scroll-mt-24 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 p-6 sm:p-8 dark:border-stone-800">
          <header class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">
                  {study.area}
                </p>
                {study.status && (
                  <span class="rounded-full bg-amber-100 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-amber-700 dark:bg-amber-400/10 dark:text-amber-400">
                    {study.status}
                  </span>
                )}
              </div>
              <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">{study.title}</h2>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-stone-500">{study.period}</span>
          </header>

          <div class="mt-6 rounded-lg bg-stone-50 p-4 dark:bg-stone-900/60">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500">Core question</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-base font-medium">{study.question}</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-7 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr]">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500">The constraint</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
                {study.context}
              </p>

              <h3 class="mt-7 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500">What shipped</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
                {study.outcome}
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              {study.deadEnd && (
                <div class="mb-7 border-l-2 border-stone-300 pl-4 dark:border-stone-700">
                  <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500">First attempt, and why it did not hold</h3>
                  <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
                    {study.deadEnd.approach}
                  </p>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
                    {study.deadEnd.why}
                  </p>
                </div>
              )}
              <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500">Investigation → system</h3>
              <ol class="mt-3 space-y-3">
                {study.approach.map((step, index) => (
                  <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">
                      0{index + 1}
                    </span>
                    <span class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">{step}</span>
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ol>

              {study.note && (
                <p class="handwritten mt-8 border-l-2 border-amber-400 pl-4 text-[18px] leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300">
                  {study.note}
                </p>
              )}
            </div>
          </div>

          {study.id === 'reliable-agents' && <GeniePipeline />}

          {study.id === 'lidar-segmentation' && (
            <figure class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-2xl overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-[#f8faef] dark:border-stone-700">
              <img
                src={`${base}/img/lidar-tower-segmentation.webp`}
                alt="Three point-cloud segmentation views of transmission towers, with two structures highlighted in yellow and one in blue."
                width="1768"
                height="890"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
                class="h-auto w-full"
              />
              <figcaption class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-t border-stone-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-xs dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-950">
                <span class="font-semibold text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
                  Qualitative segmentation
                </span>
                <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-500">
                  Transmission-tower geometries
                </span>
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
          )}

          <footer class="mt-7 grid gap-5 border-t border-stone-200 pt-5 sm:grid-cols-2 dark:border-stone-800">
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500">Evidence</p>
              <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                {study.evidence.map((item) => (
                  <span class="rounded-md bg-stone-100 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:text-stone-300">
                    {item}
                  </span>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500">Tools</p>
              <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-stone-500">
                {study.stack.join(' · ')}
              </p>
            </div>
          </footer>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-10">
      <details class="group">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-stone-500">Earlier work</p>
            <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Coursework and foundations</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
              University projects from 2021–22. Kept partly because the fundamentals hold up, mostly because deleting them sounded like work.
            </p>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xl text-stone-500 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 dark:text-stone-400" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="mt-10 space-y-10">
          {earlierWork.map((group) => (
            <section>
              <h3 class="border-b border-stone-200 pb-3 text-base font-semibold dark:border-stone-800">
                {group.group}
              </h3>
              <div class="mt-4 grid items-start gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
                {group.projects.map((project) => (
                  <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800">
                    {(project.image || project.video) && (
                      <div class="aspect-[16/10] w-full border-b border-stone-200 bg-stone-100 dark:border-stone-800 dark:bg-stone-900">
                        {project.video ? (
                          <video
                            class="h-full w-full object-contain"
                            src={`${base}/img/${project.video}`}
                            poster={project.poster ? `${base}/img/${project.poster}` : undefined}
                            aria-label={project.alt}
                            autoplay
                            loop
                            muted
                            playsinline
                            preload="none"
                          />
                        ) : (
                          <img
                            class="h-full w-full object-contain"
                            src={`${base}/img/${project.image}`}
                            alt={project.alt ?? ''}
                            loading="lazy"
                            decoding="async"
                          />
                        )}
                      </div>
                    )}
                    <div class="p-4">
                      <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
                        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold">{project.title}</h4>
                        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-500">{project.year}</span>
                      </div>
                      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">{project.description}</p>
                      <a
                        href={project.github}
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener"
                        class="mt-3 inline-block text-xs font-medium text-amber-600 hover:underline dark:text-amber-400"
                      >
                        GitHub ↗
                      </a>
                    </div>
                  </article>
                ))}
              </div>
            </section>
          ))}
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-10">
    <div class="rounded-xl bg-stone-900 p-6 text-white sm:flex sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:gap-8 sm:p-8 dark:bg-stone-100 dark:text-stone-900">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Want the chronological version?</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-stone-300 dark:text-stone-600">
